    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18055" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐχέν-ιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>belonging to the neck,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τένοντες αὐ.</span>
			<i>neck</i>-sinews, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				3.450
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pancrat.
				<u>Oxy.</u>
				1085.29
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαίτη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>C.</u>
					3.255
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίχες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					10.28
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>stiff-necked, haughty,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γίγαντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PMag.Par.</u>
					1.3058
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> a kind of
				<i>tunic,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				315
			</span></i>.</div>
